    "abstract": "This document presents a consolidated version of Burkhard Heim’s mass formula\n      for elementary particles, incorporating the corrections and extensions published in\n      1989 into the original 1982 formulation. The unified theory describes the masses,\n      lifetimes, fine-structure constant, and neutrino states of elementary particles based\n      on a geometric-dynamical structure of spacetime.",
